<title>USA: Borders Group Q1 shr profit nil vs loss.</title>
<headline>Borders Group Q1 shr profit nil vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>ANN ARBOR, Mich. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORDERS GROUP, INC.</p>
<p>		  Sales and Earnings Summary</p>
<p>		(dollars in millions, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>					Quarter Ended</p>
<p>			  April 27, 1997	April 28, 1996	%</p>
<p>			$     % Sales	 $     % Sales    Change</p>
<p> Borders		     266.3   57.4%  203.8   50.4%   30.7%</p>
<p> Waldenbooks		 197.3   42.6%  200.2   49.6%  (1.4%)</p>
<p>    Total sales	    463.6  100.0%  404.0  100.0%   14.8%</p>
<p>Cost of goods sold,</p>
<p>  incl occupancy	   350.8   75.7%  310.8   76.9%   12.9%</p>
<p>    Gross margin	   112.8   24.3%   93.2   23.1%   21.0%</p>
<p>Selling, general &amp; admin.</p>
<p>  expenses		   110.4   23.8%   96.2   23.8%   14.8%</p>
<p> Pre-opening expense	 0.3    0.1%    0.4    0.1% (25.0%)</p>
<p> Goodwill amortization     0.3    0.1%    0.3    0.1%    0.0%</p>
<p>Operating loss, stores</p>
<p>  identified for closure    --    0.0%     --    0.0%	--</p>
<p>Operating Income (loss)</p>
<p>				   1.8    0.4%  (3.7)  (0.9%)  148.6%</p>
<p> Interest expense	    1.0    0.2%    1.9    0.5%   47.4%</p>
<p>    Loss before taxes	0.8    0.2%  (5.6)  (1.4%)  114.3%</p>
<p> Income taxes		  0.4    0.1%  (2.2)  (0.5%)  118.2%</p>
<p>    Net income (loss)	0.4    0.1%  (3.4)  (0.8%)  111.8%</p>
<p> EPS			    0.00	-- (0.04)	--	--</p>
<p>Weighted avg. common</p>
<p>  shares (000's)	  81,868	--  81,834     --	--</p>
<p>Note: Borders said comparable store sales in the quarter were up  9.5 percent at Borders and 1.1 percent at Waldenbooks. The company opened six new Borders Superstores in the quarter bringing the number of Borders Superstores to 163; opened one Walden Mall Bookstore and closed 32 reducing the number of stores to 930.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
